{"completed": true, "response": "计数按正文叙事条目估算，不把“←”和“⟲”的注释单独计入。总体排序是 **图B ＞ 图C ＞ 图D ＞ 图A**：图B最适合直接交给视频制作；图C表达更自然，但部分箭头关键词截断、结尾归纳重复；图D保留了更多心理转折，却过于冗长；图A的问题主要是历史连接注释过密，以及末段总结反复。\n\n```json\n{\n  \"ranking\": [\"图B\", \"图C\", \"图D\", \"图A\"],\n  \"graphs\": {\n    \"图A\": {\n      \"why_now\": 8,\n      \"center\": 6,\n      \"history_connection\": 7,\n      \"insight\": 8,\n      \"accumulation\": 8,\n      \"faithful\": 8,\n      \"standalone\": 8,\n      \"efficiency\": 5,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 8,\n      \"words\": 6,\n      \"glance\": 5,\n      \"items_now\": 96,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 74,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"Center\",\n          \"quote\": \"向外行动与旧梦都要求投入，却彼此牵制。\",\n          \"type\": \"不具体\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"181–205\",\n          \"quote\": \"⟲ 仍在起作用：（1–23）「两难初现」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"216–225\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 说明：（92–115）「决定仍值得坚持」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"226–241\",\n          \"quote\": \"承认这一点，并没有让他轻松。想到仍要付出的东西，他还是会心疼\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 提供理由：（24–65）「付出带来快乐」；← 限制：（116–147）「坚定变成苛责」；← 提供理由：（148–180）「真实的安宁」；← 限制：（181–205）「害怕耗尽温柔」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"走过这一切，他更清楚，什么确实值得付出，什么不能在付出中被轻易牺牲。\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"他仍向往安宁，也仍愿意行动。他不知道自己最终能留下多少珍贵的东西。\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 6,\n      \"verdict\": \"心理过程基本忠实，具体经历也大多能串起来；但历史箭头标注过密，末段连续归纳已经获得的认识，削弱了真正的推进感和画面阅读效率。\"\n    },\n    \"图B\": {\n      \"why_now\": 8,\n      \"center\": 6,\n      \"history_connection\": 6,\n      \"insight\": 8,\n      \"accumulation\": 8,\n      \"faithful\": 8,\n      \"standalone\": 8,\n      \"efficiency\": 9,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 7,\n      \"words\": 7,\n      \"glance\": 9,\n      \"items_now\": 69,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 59,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"Center\",\n          \"quote\": \"向外行动与旧梦都要求投入，却彼此牵制。\",\n          \"type\": \"不具体\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–65\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（1–23）「摇摆久了，他越来越为」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–65\",\n          \"quote\": \"心思更多放在投入上，软弱时也接着做。\",\n          \"type\": \"不具体\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"92–115\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 提供理由：（24–65）「还没想清楚」终于不\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"216–225\",\n          \"quote\": \"行动曾把他从犹疑里带出来，旧愿也给过安宁；可两条路各有缺口，谁都解不了所有难处。\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"一路走来，他更清楚哪些东西值得付出，哪些不能在争取中轻易牺牲。\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 8,\n      \"verdict\": \"四张中整体最适合视频呈现：大多数段落一两眼就能读懂，关键心理变化没有被大幅压缩。主要短板是个别表达不够具体、两条历史箭头的关键词截断，以及最后的总结略有重复。\"\n    },\n    \"图C\": {\n      \"why_now\": 8,\n      \"center\": 6,\n      \"history_connection\": 6,\n      \"insight\": 8,\n      \"accumulation\": 8,\n      \"faithful\": 7,\n      \"standalone\": 8,\n      \"efficiency\": 8,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 8,\n      \"words\": 8,\n      \"glance\": 8,\n      \"items_now\": 77,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 63,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"Center\",\n          \"quote\": \"向外行动与旧梦都要求投入，却彼此牵制。\",\n          \"type\": \"不具体\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–65\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（1–23）「每次快信自己想通了，」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–65\",\n          \"quote\": \"从前总问值不值，如今只说愿尽力。\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"148–180\",\n          \"quote\": \"这回他让爱惜本身留下，不拿责任盘问，也不急着证明它有用或追问能否实现、孰轻孰重。\",\n          \"type\": \"可省细节\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"214–215\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 唤起：（206–213）「他愿再爱惜片刻，暂不」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"216–225\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 说明：（92–115）「他仍愿坚持那个决定：」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"226–241\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 提供理由：（216–225）「想得久了，那种非得舍」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"这一切让他更清楚：哪些值得付出，哪些不能在付出时轻易丢掉。\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 7,\n      \"verdict\": \"比图D紧凑，心理活动也写得自然，尤其把温柔为何会成为行动理由讲清楚了。但部分历史箭头使用未完成的句子作为关键词，影响因果辨认；个别压缩还弱化了原稿中从犹豫到自愿尽力的真实变化。\"\n    },\n    \"图D\": {\n      \"why_now\": 9,\n      \"center\": 6,\n      \"history_connection\": 7,\n      \"insight\": 9,\n      \"accumulation\": 8,\n      \"faithful\": 9,\n      \"standalone\": 9,\n      \"efficiency\": 5,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 8,\n      \"words\": 7,\n      \"glance\": 5,\n      \"items_now\": 102,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 78,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"Center\",\n          \"quote\": \"向外行动与旧梦都要求投入，却彼此牵制。\",\n          \"type\": \"不具体\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"66–91\",\n          \"quote\": \"他发现自己不只有沉重和责任，也会因不再畏缩而高兴。\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"116–147\",\n          \"quote\": \"他知道自己在受苦，却把心里的难处当成必须克服的迟疑，想停一停又怕那是退缩。\",\n          \"type\": \"附带理由\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"216–225\",\n          \"quote\": \"他看出，靠决心向前和沉浸在旧愿里都曾帮过他，也各自留下难处。\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"他感到，对那种生活的向往让他不肯袖手旁观，若在争取中丢掉它，尽力也会失去意义。\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"他不必为依恋感到羞耻，也不必因责任而厌倦珍惜。\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"254–288\",\n          \"quote\": \"他仍向往安宁，也仍愿意行动，却不知道最终能留下多少珍贵的东西。\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 7,\n      \"verdict\": \"四张中对原稿心理因果和细微转折保留得最好，尤其写出了坚持为何变成自我苛责，以及重新理解希望后发生的变化。但条目过多，同一认识常被连续解释两三次，扫读时不够利落，不适合未经修剪直接进入视频。\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b2ea338e-1ef0-4d34-ab13-98c5131d27cc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261022T033246822424Z", "elapsed_seconds": 291.703, "completed_utc": "2026-10-22T03:37:38.523925+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "44e0e40451b4c13bfbb5f1072864a2a23d9502d02a54772ed3683b6d65047953", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musiccla